## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** GLM 4.6 Flash
- **Short description:** Z.ai's free text-only Flash variant of GLM-4.6 with a 128K window, tool calling and reasoning; a distinct serving tier from the 355B-class GLM-4.6 flagship.
- **Provider / access:** Z.ai Flash tier and OpenCode Zen (`opencode/glm-4.6-flash`), OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** GLM-4.6 generation (late 2025); exact Flash date not published.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.6-flash`, `opencode/glm-4.6-flash`.
- **Context window:** 131,072 (128K) — Z.ai docs / curated metadata.
- **Modalities:** text in/out; reasoning; tool calling.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-23):** Free ($0/$0) on the Z.ai Flash tier.
- **Architecture:** lightweight 4.6-generation text model; proprietary endpoint.

