### Why the file is excluded (evidence trail)

- Vals AI's GLM-4.6 page reports the flagship model only: GPQA Diamond 74.50%, LiveCodeBench 81.04%, LegalBench 79.61%, MMLU-Pro 82.2; BenchLM mirrors those with no Flash row.
